WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.292
Start in Clients.

2
00:00:02.312 --> 00:00:06.084
Open your client and check its account manager and video editor.

3
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:12.620
In Content, choose a campaign or General and Ongoing.

4
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.740
Add your title and format, then save.

5
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.580
Content describes the post; it does not create a task.

6
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.156
Choose Add task to assign production work.

7
00:00:23.176 --> 00:00:25.844
Check the editor and create the task.

8
00:00:25.864 --> 00:00:29.684
The designated video editor receives the assignment.

9
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:33.660
The editor uploads files and submits for review.

10
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:37.404
The supervisor checks the work and approves it for the client.

11
00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.324
Send the files to your client outside Jota.

12
00:00:43.344 --> 00:00:47.308
Mark them sent, then record the client approval when they reply.

13
00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.292
Save the posting schedule.

14
00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:59.676
After posting on your usual platform, mark the content Published in Jota.
